---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
    title="Mental Tools — Less."
    description="Discover practical mental minimalism tools: meditation apps and journaling resources for a quieter mind."
    path="/mind/tools"
    section="mind"
>
        <section class="hero small">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <h1>Mental Tools</h1>
                <p class="subtitle">Resources for a quieter mind.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-shapes">
                <div class="shape shape-1"></div>
                <div class="shape shape-2"></div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="content-section">
            <h2>Mindfulness & Meditation</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">A quieter mind isn't found by doing more — it's uncovered by doing less, more deliberately.</p>
            <div class="cards">
                <a href="https://insighttimer.com/" class="card" data-tilt target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <h3>Insight Timer</h3>
                    <p>The world's largest free meditation app. Over 100,000 guided meditations from thousands of teachers — no subscription required.</p>
                    <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
                </a>
                <a href="https://www.wakingup.com/" class="card" data-tilt target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <h3>Waking Up</h3>
                    <p>Sam Harris's meditation app takes a rigorously secular, intellectually honest approach to mindfulness. Theory and practice in equal measure.</p>
                    <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
                </a>
                <a href="https://oakmeditation.com/" class="card" data-tilt target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <h3>Oak</h3>
                    <p>A beautifully minimal meditation and breathing app for iOS. No social feed, no streaks, no noise — just practice.</p>
                    <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="content-section">
            <h2>Journaling & Reflection</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">Writing by hand slows down your thinking and creates the space to hear yourself clearly.</p>
            <div class="cards">
                <a href="https://fieldnotesbrand.com/" class="card" data-tilt target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <h3>Field Notes</h3>
                    <p>Small, sturdy American-made notebooks designed for capture, not collection. Keep one in your pocket. Write things down. Think better.</p>
                    <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
                </a>
                <a href="https://www.leuchtturm1917.com/" class="card" data-tilt target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <h3>Leuchtturm1917</h3>
                    <p>A premium German notebook beloved by bullet journal practitioners. Numbered pages, an index, and paper that won't bleed through.</p>
                    <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
                </a>
                <a href="https://stoic.app/" class="card" data-tilt target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <h3>Stoic</h3>
                    <p>A journaling app built around Stoic philosophy. Daily prompts, mood tracking, and reflections drawn from Marcus Aurelius, Seneca, and Epictetus.</p>
                    <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="content-section next-step">
            <h2>Tools Are Just the Start</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">A clearer mind comes from daily practice. Build the habits that quiet the noise for good.</p>
            <div class="next-step-links">
                <a href="/mind/habits" class="cta-button">Build Daily Habits</a>
            </div>
        </section>
</Layout>
